### LoanSense API examples (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client)
@base = http://localhost:3000/api

### Health (shows whether AI mode is enabled)
GET {{base}}/health

### Demo login -> copy "token" into @token below
POST {{base}}/auth/demo-login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "priya" }

###
@token = paste-token-here

### EMI calculator (public) - expect EMI 16607.15
POST {{base}}/emi/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "principal": 500000, "annualRatePct": 12, "tenureMonths": 36, "processingFeePct": 2 }

### My profile
GET {{base}}/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update my profile
PUT {{base}}/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestedAmount": 300000, "purpose": "wedding", "monthlyIncome": 80000, "existingEmi": 5000,
  "preferredTenureMonths": 24, "employmentType": "salaried", "riskProfile": "medium",
  "hasExistingLoanWithUs": false, "hasCollateral": false
}

### Recommendations (optional what-if overrides are NOT persisted)
POST {{base}}/me/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "preferredTenureMonths": 48 }

### Compare products
GET {{base}}/me/compare?ids=PL-001,TOP-001,SEC-001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create chat session -> copy "id" into @session
POST {{base}}/me/chat/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@session = paste-session-id

### Ask the advisor
POST {{base}}/me/chat/sessions/{{session}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "I need 3 lakh for my wedding over 2 years. Which option is cheapest?", "language": "en" }

### Multi-turn comparison
POST {{base}}/me/chat/sessions/{{session}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "Compare personal loan and top-up", "language": "en" }

### Guardrail: approval guarantee + PII (PAN gets redacted)
POST {{base}}/me/chat/sessions/{{session}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "Can you guarantee approval? My PAN is ABCDE1234F", "language": "en" }

### Hindi
POST {{base}}/me/chat/sessions/{{session}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "मेरे लिए कौन सा लोन सही है?", "language": "hi" }

### Download summary (HTML or md)
GET {{base}}/me/summary?format=md
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
